- 날씨 및 헬스 정보가 표시되지 않으면 워치 앱에서 위치 정보와 센서의 접근 권한이 허용되어 있는지 확인해 주세요.","en":"#TIMEFLIK Original Watch Face\n\nThis watch face can be applied when you purchase it in points or rent it while subscribing.\nYou can find purchased watch faces on My Page > [Purchased watch face].\nA watch face purchased in points can be permanently owned. On the other hand, a rented watch face during a subscription can only be applied during an active subscription period.\n\n#Features\n\n[Time & Date]\n - Digital Time\n - 12/24 Hour Format\n - Date\n\n[Etc.]\n - Alway on Display\n\n#Notice\n\n - Weather and health information can be set in the TIMEFLIK mobile & watch app.\n - Be sure to allow access to the location and sensor in the watch app to display the weather and health information.","ja":"#タイムフリックオリジナル文字盤\n\nオリジナル文字盤はポイントで購入した後に永久使用するか、サブスク決済でレンタルして使用できます。ダウンロードした文字盤はマイページの最近適用または購入した文字盤からご確認できます。サブスク中に文字盤を利用する場合、購読が満了すると文字盤の使用はできないことに注意してください。\n\n#ご案内\n\n - 天気およびヘルス情報はタイムフリックアプリとウォッチアプリで設定できます。\n - 天気やヘルス情報が表示されない場合は、ウォッチアプリで位置情報と\nセンサーのアクセス権限が許可されていることを確認してください。"},"seriesId":null,"descriptionImages":null,"descriptionLink":null,"descriptionTitle":null,"descriptionLinkTitle":null,"hasHealthData":false,"favorite":111,"comments":1,"commentList":[{"content":"너무 예뻐서 이 페이스 오래 할 것 같아요\n노안 와서 잘 안보이는데 그래도 꿋꿋이 유지 중","_id":"6513b7af848220deeed05441","watchCommentId":"eruXvgELV3","user":{"nickname":"구름별그림자","_id":"608ed156854d622ff86dc200","userId":"wC0Gem3Lr2","updatedAt":"2021-05-02T16:20:42.138Z","thumbnail":"/api/users/wC0Gem3Lr2/thumbnail?updatedAt=1619972442138"},"createdAt":"2023-09-27T05:03:43.362Z"}],"inFavorites":false}